                                            "A symbol designating the beginning of a new paragraph."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81ba92ab-7157-4c48-87ae-d393a840da05",
                                                "sense_id": "d5cf27f5-353f-37e8-b45b-0c8f2f90dd19",
                                                "text": "The pilcrow was a simple punctuation symbol used by medieval scribes to indicate the start and end of a paragraph."
                                            }
